{"name":"Sachet Cushion","hex":"#d4d8ed","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"sachet","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small scented cloth bag filled with fragrant material such as herbs or potpourri.","A cheesecloth bag of herbs or spices added during cooking and then removed before serving."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sachet"},{"term":"cushion","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A soft mass of material stuffed into a cloth bag, used for comfort or support.\n\n A throw pillow.\nA thin, flat pad used on hard chairs and sometimes toilet seats.","A throw pillow."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To furnish with cushions.","To seat or place on, or as on a cushion."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cushion"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sachet","blocks":[{"text":"Although its most usual definition is that listed under \"packet\", a sachet can also mean a small scented cloth bag filled with herbs, potpourri, or aromatic ingredients; or a small porous bag or packet containing a material intended to interact with its atmosphere; for example, desiccants are usually packed in sachets which are then placed in larger packages. Cotton, linen or organza are used to create the bag."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Tan_Plaid_Lavender_Sachets.jpg/330px-Tan_Plaid_Lavender_Sachets.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sachet","wikidata":"Q2597618"},{"title":"Cushion","blocks":[{"text":"A cushion is a soft bag of some ornamental material, usually stuffed with wool, hair, feathers, polyester staple fiber, non-woven material, cotton, or even paper torn into fragments. It may be used for sitting or kneeling upon, or to soften the hardness or angularity of a chair or couch. Decorative cushions often have a patterned cover material, and are used as decoration for furniture."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Throw_Pillows_%28Scatter_Cushions%29.jpg/330px-Throw_Pillows_%28Scatter_Cushions%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cushion","wikidata":"Q10971235"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Sachets_d%C3%A9shydratants_sodepac.JPG/330px-Sachets_d%C3%A9shydratants_sodepac.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Sachets_d%C3%A9shydratants_sodepac.JPG/330px-Sachets_d%C3%A9shydratants_sodepac.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Sachets containing desiccants","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASachets_d%C3%A9shydratants_sodepac.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Crewel_sachet_2.jpg/250px-Crewel_sachet_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Crewel_sachet_2.jpg/330px-Crewel_sachet_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Crewel_sachet_2.jpg/250px-Crewel_sachet_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACrewel_sachet_2.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Lavender_bag_1.jpg/250px-Lavender_bag_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Lavender_bag_1.jpg/330px-Lavender_bag_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Lavender_bag_1.jpg/250px-Lavender_bag_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumb